<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69261" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠρίκ-η</span></b>  [on the quantity v.
		infr.], ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tamarisk</i> (in Greece, <i>Tamarix tetrandra</i>; in
			Egypt, <i>Tamarix articulata</i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆκεν
				ἀνὰ μυρίκην [ῐ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.466
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρίκης ἐριθηλέας
			ὄζους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				467
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρυ . . κεκλιμένον μυρίκῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				612
			</span></i>; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτελέαι τε καὶ ἰτέαι ἠδὲ μυρῖκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.350
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.101
			</span></i>, and Lat. <i>myrīca</i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μυρίκης πεποιημένη θύρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.96
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρίκης κλῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					119
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				383.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
